    {
      "id": "canon",
      "title": "Dark S1-S3 (Netflix)",
      "kind": "canon_statement",
      "text": "Winden's cave connects 1920, 1953, 1986, 2019, 2053. Jonas travels between eras; Martha dies in 2019 (S2) and an alternate Martha saves Jonas (S3). The Unknown exists across eras. Charlotte is Elisabeth's daughter; Elisabeth is Charlotte's daughter - a bootstrap pair. Adam (old Jonas) and Eva orchestrate the knot; S3 ends with the origin world deleting both knot worlds."
    },
    {
      "id": "allocation",
      "title": "Fixture allocations",
      "kind": "test_fixture",
      "text": "Eras are charted as lanes (preexisting). Cave trips are transfers (time_travel, body). The Charlotte/Elisabeth bootstrap is recorded as genealogy edges + a closed cycle object per schema; render support for cycles is OPEN (E244). The origin-world deletion is a beat, not a universe split (knot worlds preexist)."
    }
